From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*skīraz}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|skire}}, {{cog|osx|skīr}}, {{cog|nl|schier||white, grey}}, {{cog|de|schier||pure}}), {{cog|non|skírr}} ({{cog|sv|skir}}), {{cog|got|𐍃𐌺𐌴𐌹𐍂𐍃|sc=Goth}} Related to {{m|ang|scinan}}.

